{"time": 1755596460, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1749529729", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "786980363", "user_id": "3625185457"}, "sender": {"id": "3625185457", "name": "多拉贡"}, "message": "“你好，老板”对方大概把你当成了管理员“最近一切正常”"}
{"time": 1755596488, "type": "recv", "message_id": "855733243", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "786980363", "user_id": "3625185457"}, "sender": {"id": "3625185457", "name": "多拉贡"}, "message": "（哎不过，潜行自动成功其实是佣兵的专属来着（））"}
{"time": 1755596581, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2030820008", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "786980363", "user_id": "458095233"}, "sender": {"id": "458095233", "name": "风铃浅唱"}, "message": "（什么潜行，我这不是大摇大摆）"}
{"time": 1755596648, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1062654887", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "786980363", "user_id": "3625185457"}, "sender": {"id": "3625185457", "name": "多拉贡"}, "message": "（暗示自动成功就显得佣兵有点小丑.jpg）"}
{"time": 1755596728, "type": "recv", "message_id": "825550805", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "786980363", "user_id": "458095233"}, "sender": {"id": "458095233", "name": "风铃浅唱"}, "message": "“是吗，最近那些下等人还有在这附近游荡的吗”摆出一幅趾高气扬的样子"}
{"time": 1755596858, "type": "recv", "message_id": "606275486", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "786980363", "user_id": "3625185457"}, "sender": {"id": "3625185457", "name": "多拉贡"}, "message": "“老板，明天就是万圣节了，这几天人流量还不少”他一副低眉顺眼的样子“早上还好，下午开始人就多起来了”"}
{"time": 1755596976, "type": "recv", "message_id": "402158894", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "786980363", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1062654887]（那你暗骰呗）"}
{"time": 1755597082, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1320387469", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "786980363", "user_id": "458095233"}, "sender": {"id": "458095233", "name": "风铃浅唱"}, "message": "“嘁，赶热闹爱瞎逛的游客吗。倒也无妨，最多只是瞎看看就会散了，那些无所事事的流浪汉呢”"}
{"time": 1755597200, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1152825687", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "786980363", "user_id": "3625185457"}, "sender": {"id": "3625185457", "name": "多拉贡"}, "message": "“倒是没看到来凑热闹的，本地人们看到了都会赶走，晚上我也都清了场的”"}
{"time": 1755597376, "type": "recv", "message_id": "669530840", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "786980363", "user_id": "458095233"}, "sender": {"id": "458095233", "name": "风铃浅唱"}, "message": "“做的不错，值得夸奖。我再去里面看看，就不用陪同了”"}
{"time": 1755597433, "type": "recv", "message_id": "350657812", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "786980363", "user_id": "3625185457"}, "sender": {"id": "3625185457", "name": "多拉贡"}, "message": "“好嘞好嘞”大门敞开着，实际上并不会特别核实进去的人的身份就是了"}
